3,Oko language and alphabet,https://omniglot.com/writing/oko.htm,Oko is a Volta-Niger language spoken mainly in the Ogori-Magongo LGA in Kogi State in southern Nigeria.,Oko-Eni-Osayen,Niger-Congo
